.godot/
*.tmp
*.translation
*.swp
export_presets.cfg
build/
docs/vault/.obsidian/
docs/archive/vault/.obsidian/

# Generated art. Every file under assets/_generated/ (chess, tiles, maps, rooms,
# piece_templates) is rebuilt from scratch by a script in tools/, so the repo
# carries the generator and not its output — otherwise one tweaked constant churns
# hundreds of binary files in the diff. Never hand-edit anything in there.
assets/_generated/

# The sprites that used to sit in assets/sprites/generated/ are source art (no
# script draws them) and now live, tracked, in content/<kind>/<id>/body.png|icon.png
# and assets/ui/actor_view/. Hand-drawn art never goes in an ignored folder.

# NOT ignored, on purpose: assets/art/pieces/. That is hand-drawn source art.
# Nothing regenerates it and losing it loses the work.

# Parallel agent worktrees (git worktree add), never part of the project.
.claude/worktrees/
